---
import { SCHEDULES, SITE_BRAND } from '../data/catalog';
---

<section id="horarios" class="section section-soft" aria-labelledby="horarios-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">ATENCIÓN PRESENCIAL</span>
      <h2 id="horarios-heading" class="section-title">
        Horarios y <span class="accent">Recepción en Sede</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Nuestro centro en Juliaca mantiene turnos regulares de lunes a domingo con registro asistido en recepción.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="schedules-grid">
      <div class="card-light schedule-table-card">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <h3>Horario Regular de Entrenamiento</h3>
          <span class="badge-pill">Zona America/Lima</span>
        </div>

        <ul class="schedule-list">
          {SCHEDULES.map((item) => (
            <li class="schedule-row">
              <div>
                <span class="day-label">{item.days}</span>
                {item.note && <span class="day-sub">{item.note}</span>}
              </div>
              <strong class="hour-value">{item.hours}</strong>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <p class="schedule-policy">
          * El ingreso a sala de musculación se realiza mediante escaneo QR personal hasta {SITE_BRAND.checkInCutMinutes} minutos antes del cierre.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-light reception-card">
        <div class="card-top-row">
          <h3>Requisitos y Medios de Pago</h3>
          <span class="badge-pill">100% Presencial</span>
        </div>

        <dl class="reception-dl">
          <div>
            <dt>Ubicación Principal</dt>
            <dd>{SITE_BRAND.sedeNombre} — {SITE_BRAND.sedeCiudad}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Documentación para Alta</dt>
            <dd>DNI o Carnet de Extranjería vigente. Menores requieren presencia y firma del apoderado.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Medios Aceptados</dt>
            <dd>Efectivo (PEN), tarjeta en POS, Yape, Plin, transferencia bancaria o enlace CulqiLink emitido en mostrador.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Consultas e Incidencias</dt>
            <dd><a href={`mailto:${SITE_BRAND.supportEmail}`} class="inline-gold-link">{SITE_BRAND.supportEmail}</a></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="reception-actions">
          <a href="/contacto" class="btn btn-dark btn-full">Ver Canales Oficiales de Contacto</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .schedules-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.75rem;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .card-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-top-row h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--vf-ink);
  }

  .badge-pill {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--vf-gold-ink);
    background-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.16);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .schedule-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .schedule-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--vf-border);
  }

  .day-label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--vf-ink);
  }

  .day-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--vf-muted);
  }

  .hour-value {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--vf-gold-ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .schedule-policy {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--vf-muted);
  }

  .reception-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .reception-dl {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .reception-dl dt {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--vf-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .reception-dl dd {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: var(--vf-ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .inline-gold-link {
    color: var(--vf-gold-ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .reception-actions {
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .schedules-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
